      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This study examined whether estrogen replacement therapy (ERT) in postmenopausal women impacts intermediate and long-term outcome after successful coronary stenting. Our findings offer evidence that ERT significantly reduces target lesion revascularization after intracoronary stenting in postmenopausal patients who are on ERT before the intervention."},
